 Gamingshop

A web shop for gamers where users can browse and buy video games.

University project for the **Software Engineering** course.

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- **Java** + **Spring Boot**
- **HTML** / Thymeleaf (frontend)
- **Maven** (build)

## ✨ Features

- Browse the game catalog
- View game details
- Add games to cart and place orders

